    "description": "### Impact\r\nThe discourse-graphviz plugin contains a stored cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability that allows authenticated users to inject malicious JavaScript code through DOT graph definitions. For instances with CSP disabled only. \r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nDisable the graphviz plugin, upgrade to a patched version or enable CSP. ",
